# Closing with a 30 mm part expected and nothing between the jaws: the
# fingers close to 0, EMPTY, the machine goes off (off_reason 8).
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate_gripper.arm
detector arm/arcmate/model_perturbed.arm
lcnc 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1
run 1.5
grip expect 30 2.0 0 0 0.15
grip close
run 2.5
print grip off
@expect arm.grip_state == 4
@expect arm.grip_width < 1
@expect arm.pay_model == 0
@expect arm.off_reason == 8
@reject ^ERROR
